@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<main class="policy-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 29, 2026</p>

    <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how AxertLMS handles information when you use
        the Axert University learning management system.
    </p>

    <h2>Information the service handles</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Account details such as your name, email address, role, and sign-in information.</li>
        <li>Student registration and academic information entered into or generated by the LMS, such as enrollment, classroom, assignment, submission, and grade records.</li>
        <li>
            If you choose Google sign-in, Google provides your account identifier,
            email address, and basic profile information needed to authenticate you
            and link your LMS account.
        </li>
        <li>
            If you choose to connect Google Calendar, the service requests calendar
            access for calendar features. OAuth access and refresh tokens are stored
            encrypted by the application.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>
        Information is used to authenticate accounts, administer student and staff
        access, operate learning and academic features, and provide optional Google
        Calendar functionality when you connect that service.
    </p>

    <h2>Google and service providers</h2>
    <p>
        Google sign-in and optional Google Calendar features communicate with Google
        services. AxertLMS is hosted using MonsterASP and stores application data in
        its configured database. These providers process information as needed to
        provide their services and under their applicable terms and privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention and requests</h2>
    <p>
        Information is retained as needed to operate the LMS and administer
        educational records, subject to applicable institutional and legal retention
        requirements. To ask a question, request access to your information, or
        request deletion where permitted, contact
        <a href="mailto:kurtcandrejo@gmail.com">kurtcandrejo@gmail.com</a>.
        Some academic or administrative records may need to be retained.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
        The application uses safeguards intended to protect information, including
        encrypted storage of Google OAuth tokens. No online service can guarantee
        absolute security.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>
        This policy may be updated as the service changes. Questions about this
        policy can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:kurtcandrejo@gmail.com">kurtcandrejo@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
</main>

<style>
    .policy-page {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .policy-page h1,
    .policy-page h2 {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .policy-page a {
        color: #8ab4f8;
    }
</style>
